Thank you for taking the time to speak with me today. It was a pleasure visiting {{account_name}}, learning more about the services your team provides, and discussing how Green Dog can help fill any gaps in care for your patients.

Green Dog serves as an extension of local veterinary practices by providing advanced services that may not be available in-house, including:

• Advanced dentistry and oral and maxillofacial surgery
• Advanced imaging, including CT, ultrasound, and digital radiography
• Internal medicine and specialty diagnostics
• Exotic animal medicine and surgery

Green Dog is home to one of Los Angeles’ leading veterinary dentistry and oral and maxillofacial surgery centers. Our dental program is led by Dr. Ren Garcia, Professor of Dentistry and Oral Surgery at Western University of Health Sciences College of Veterinary Medicine. Through this relationship, Green Dog also serves as a veterinary dental teaching hospital connected to an AVMA-accredited veterinary college.

Our goal is to work collaboratively with your team, provide excellent care for the services you refer, and return patients to your hospital for their continued primary care.

We also support the Los Angeles veterinary community through Green Dog University, where we offer RACE-approved continuing education courses and professional learning opportunities. You can learn more and view upcoming programs here:

https://www.greendoguniversity.com/

I would be happy to provide referral materials, service information, or assist your team with any patient referrals. Thank you again for welcoming me into your hospital. I look forward to building a strong relationship between our teams.

Warmly,

