I hope you’re doing well and {{account_name}} is thriving! I wanted to check in and see whether you’ve had any recent adoptions.

As each pet is adopted, Green Dog needs to remove the pet from your rescue’s account in our veterinary software and create a new profile under the adoptive owner. This ensures that your rescue is no longer associated with care provided after the adoption and that the pet’s medical records remain accurate.

For each recently adopted pet, could you please send us the following information?

• Pet’s name
• Adoption date
• New owner’s full name
• Email address
• Phone number

We would also love the opportunity to introduce Green Dog as the rescue’s veterinary partner and the pet’s existing care team. We’ll provide the new owner with digital copies of their complimentary and discounted services, welcome them to pet ownership, and let them know that we’re available to continue caring for their new family member.

Please also let us know if you need additional new-adopter packets for any upcoming adoptions. We’re happy to provide more whenever needed.

Thank you for your continued partnership and for everything you do for these animals!

Warmly,

Laurence
Referral Coordinator
Green Dog Dental & Veterinary Center
